    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1747
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "动词决定故事动作链。",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1748
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先问谁做什么，再问为什么此时会做这个动作。”",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1749
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 单看中文近义词容易都觉得通，真正区别来自主语、宾语和情节。",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1750
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1751
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 圈空前主语。",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1752
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 看空后有没有宾语/介词，排语法搭配不可能项。",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1753
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 看上一动作和下一结果，判断哪一个动作能连接。",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1754
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 再检查情绪方向和常见搭配。",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1755
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 在空旁标词性 V/N/Adj/Adv；故事题用箭头记情绪/动作，如",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1756
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "worried→help→relieved；难空先打 ? 继续。",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1757
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1758
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· see someone struggling → approach/help 更自然",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1759
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· problem solved → relax/thank/continue 等看上下文",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1760
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 动词后固定介词不匹配 → 直接排",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1761
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 动作能同时解释前因和后果。",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1762
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 两个词都认识时，把“中文意思”放一边，读成“主语 + 动词 + 宾语”比较动",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1763
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "作链。",
      "sourcePage": 63,
      "sourceIndex": 1764
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1765
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Seeing the child drop his books, Maria ___ across the hall and helped him.",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1766
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "动作链要求“走/跑过去”，而不是 simply watched。",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1767
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1768
    },
