    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 两个动词中文都通时看？",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1783
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 动作与主语不匹配要不要排？",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1784
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 完形动词只看固定搭配够吗？",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1785
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 谁做什么？；2. ran/rushed；3. 人物动机+动作链。；4. 要。；5. 不够，还要故事逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 64,
      "sourceIndex": 1786
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— C1 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“C1”或题型关键词。—",
